<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Stylist Man | Headline Hair Salon</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #F7F4EE;
      --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
      --text-main: #3C2A21;
      --text-muted: #7D6E65;
      --accent: #5C4033;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text-main);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 30px 16px;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 390px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(60, 42, 33, 0.05);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .brand {
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .avatar {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #EAE5DC;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 32px;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    h1 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    p.sub { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .btn-save {
      display: block;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #FFF;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .link-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 13px;
      border: 1px solid #EAE5DC;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="brand">HEADLINE HAIR SALON</div>
    <div class="avatar">✂️</div>
    <h1>Stylist Man</h1>
    <p class="sub">Senior Stylist & Co-Founder<br>15+ Years Experience</p>

    <a href="contact.vcf" class="btn-save" download>＋ Save to Contacts / 存入通訊錄</a>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="https://wa.me/85269991747?text=Hi%20Man%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20an%20appointment" class="link-item">💬 WhatsApp Direct Booking</a>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/headline__hair" class="link-item">📸 Instagram Portfolio</a>
      <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=50+Jervois+Street+Sheung+Wan+Hong+Kong" class="link-item">📍 Find Us in Sheung Wan</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      50 Jervois Street, Sheung Wan<br>
      One Stylist. One Client. One Experience.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
